Count from 1 to 15. For each number, if it can be divided by both 3 and 5
say "FizzBuzz", if only by 3 say "Fizz", if only by 5 say "Buzz", and
otherwise just say the number itself.
    1. For every whole number i from 1 to 15: if i divided by 15 leaves no
       remainder, print "FizzBuzz"; otherwise if i divided by 3 leaves no
       remainder, print "Fizz"; otherwise if i divided by 5 leaves no remainder,
       print "Buzz"; otherwise print i.
    Assumption: Divided by both 3 and 5 means divided by 15.
    Assumption: Every answer is printed on its own line.
